>> f := Skrá nýtt: ['/tmp/citrine_test_file.txt'].
Forrit taka-til.
usedMemory1 := (Forrit minni ? 0).



f := Skrá nýtt: ['/tmp/citrine_test_file.txt'].
Forrit taka-til.
